        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;&#39; -------------------- 9. SEQUENCE: UC-04 --------------------\n@startuml Sada_Sequence_UC04\ntitle UC-04 — Review Suspicious Case\nautonumber\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nactor \&quot;Review Employee\&quot; as Reviewer\nboundary \&quot;Staff Review Dashboard\&quot; as UI\ncontrol \&quot;Banking API\&quot; as API\ncontrol \&quot;Case Management Service\&quot; as CaseSvc\ncontrol \&quot;Ledger Service\&quot; as Ledger\ncollections \&quot;Evidence Storage\&quot; as Storage\ndatabase \&quot;Platform Database\&quot; as DB\nReviewer -&gt; UI: Open review queue\nUI -&gt; API: Request OPEN cases\nactivate API\nAPI -&gt; CaseSvc: Retrieve open cases\nactivate CaseSvc\nCaseSvc -&gt; DB: Query REVIEW_CASE\nDB --&gt; CaseSvc: Open case list\nCaseSvc --&gt; API: Case list\ndeactivate CaseSvc\nAPI --&gt; UI: Case list\ndeactivate API\nUI --&gt; Reviewer: Display review queue\nReviewer -&gt; UI: Select case\nUI -&gt; API: Request case details\nactivate API\nAPI -&gt; CaseSvc: Load case evidence\nactivate CaseSvc\nCaseSvc -&gt; DB: Read case, ticket, transfer and assessment\nDB --&gt; CaseSvc: Case details\nCaseSvc --&gt; API: Case details\ndeactivate CaseSvc\nAPI --&gt; UI: Case details and risk indicators\ndeactivate API\nUI --&gt; Reviewer: Display evidence\nopt Retained audio copy available\n Reviewer -&gt; UI: Request audio playback\n UI -&gt; API: Request authorized audio stream\n activate API\n API -&gt; Storage: Read retained review copy\n activate Storage\n Storage --&gt; API: Audio stream\n deactivate Storage\n API --&gt; UI: Audio stream\n deactivate API\n UI --&gt; Reviewer: Play recording\nend\nReviewer -&gt; UI: Submit decision and rationale\nUI -&gt; API: Submit case decision\nactivate API\nAPI -&gt; CaseSvc: Process decision\nactivate CaseSvc\nalt Decision accepted\n CaseSvc -&gt; DB: BEGIN transaction\n CaseSvc -&gt; DB: Set case ACCEPTED and save rationale\n opt Case contains held transfer\n  CaseSvc -&gt; Ledger: Complete held transfer\n  activate Ledger\n  Ledger -&gt; DB: Lock accounts and validate frozen amount\n  Ledger -&gt; DB: Post balanced debit and credit entries\n  Ledger -&gt; DB: Update balances and transfer status\n  DB --&gt; Ledger: Posting result\n  Ledger --&gt; CaseSvc: Transfer completed\n  deactivate Ledger\n end\n CaseSvc -&gt; DB: Append audit event\n CaseSvc -&gt; DB: COMMIT\nelse Decision rejected\n CaseSvc -&gt; DB: BEGIN transaction\n CaseSvc -&gt; DB: Set case REJECTED and save rationale\n opt Case contains held transfer\n  CaseSvc -&gt; Ledger: Cancel held transfer\n  activate Ledger\n  Ledger -&gt; DB: Lock source account\n  Ledger -&gt; DB: Restore frozen amount to available balance\n  Ledger -&gt; DB: Set transfer status CANCELLED\n  DB --&gt; Ledger: Cancellation result\n  Ledger --&gt; CaseSvc: Transfer cancelled\n  deactivate Ledger\n end\n CaseSvc -&gt; DB: Append audit event\n CaseSvc -&gt; DB: COMMIT\nend\nCaseSvc -&gt; Storage: Delete retained audio under retention policy\nactivate Storage\nStorage --&gt; CaseSvc: Deletion result\ndeactivate Storage\nCaseSvc -&gt; DB: Record audio deletion timestamp\nCaseSvc --&gt; API: Final case status\ndeactivate CaseSvc\nAPI --&gt; UI: Decision confirmation\ndeactivate API\nUI --&gt; Reviewer: Display final decision\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="vPecKsJ7qy07KvzmN1Pw-1">
